  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5804.04 Quick Screen Test",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5804.04 Quick Screen Test.\n\n(a) Vehicles that display visible black smoke shall be deemed to have failed the Quick Screen.\n\n(b) Said vehicles shall be directed to undergo the full SAE J1667 test procedure.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
